    "title": "京剧的行当分类是什么？",
    "category": "京剧行当",
    "author_or_organization": "福建京剧院（福建省文化和旅游厅发布）",
    "source_url": "https://wlt.fujian.gov.cn/hdjl/wdxd/202112/t20211208_5790384.htm",
